<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD FINAL CLOSE OF PLAY SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD FINAL CLOSE OF PLAY SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australia, chasing a target of 465 runs for victory, were 166 for five at close of play on the fourth day of the five-day Sheffield Shield final at the WACA Ground on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Queensland 320 and 309; Western Australia 165 and 166 for five (Tom Moody 66 not out)</p>
